WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.888
Millions worldwide live with type 1 diabetes. Insulin and other supplies are part of daily care, so reliable access matters.

00:00:10.338 --> 00:00:20.778
Sometimes supplies run short. People turn to family, friends, and small T1D groups; support can be hard to find beyond those circles.

00:00:21.228 --> 00:00:35.628
VoiceOfT1D was created after a real personal experience. This web exchange aims to help people connect worldwide; mobile access is a future goal. Community support can be lifesaving.

00:00:36.078 --> 00:00:41.046
Meet Maya. She's looking for a CGM nearby.

00:00:41.496 --> 00:00:46.224
Meanwhile, Jordan has an unopened CGM he can offer.

00:00:46.674 --> 00:00:52.434
Maya adds what she needs and a city or ZIP. No street address.

00:00:52.884 --> 00:00:58.284
A possible match appears. Maya asks Jordan to connect.

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:05.382
Jordan takes a moment to review. Maya's contact stays private while he decides.

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:11.040
He approves. Now they can talk it through and decide together.
